{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22858","headline":"端居咏怀 · 白居易","name":"端居咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾生俟罪心相似，张翰思归事不如。\n斜日早知惊鵩鸟，秋风悔不忆鲈鱼。\n胷襟曾贮匡时策，怀袖犹残谏猎书。\n从此万缘都摆落，欲携妻子买山居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}